nancy. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"P24387","text":"Specifically binds and inactivates the corticotropin-releasing hormone (CRH) and urocortin-1 (UCN) hormones, thereby inhibiting the hypothalamus-pituitary-adrenal axis and preventing corticotropin hormone (ACTH) production (PubMed:18234674, PubMed:1846945, PubMed:3494446, PubMed:7477348, PubMed:7585095). May be required to prevent inappropriate pituitary-adrenal stimulation in pregnancy (PubMed:7585095)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}